N-AF\" x=\"1724\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a radius.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>In conclusion, statements I, II, and III are true.</p>\n\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
